---
layout: base.njk
title: 日记
permalink: /diary/
---
<section class="hello hello--small">
  <h1>日记</h1>
  <p>一共 {{ collections.diary.length }} 篇。</p>
</section>
{% for group in collections.diary | byMonth %}
<section class="block">
  <h2>{{ group.label }}</h2>
  <ul class="rows">
    {% for item in group.items %}{% include "diary-row.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">还没有日记。打开后台，在“心情日记”里写下第一篇。</p>
{% endfor %}
